["|cRXP_WARN_You need {C}|r {A}{B} |cRXP_WARN_for a quest in Auberdine later|r"] = "|cRXP_WARN_你需要 {C} 點|r {A}{B} |cRXP_WARN_技能，之後在奧伯丁的任務會用到|r",
["|cRXP_WARN_You need {C}|r {A}{B} |cRXP_WARN_for a quest in Darkshire later.|r"] = "|cRXP_WARN_你需要 {C} 點|r {A}{B} |cRXP_WARN_技能，之後在夜色鎮的任務會用到。|r",
["|cRXP_WARN_You need {C}|r {A}{B} |cRXP_WARN_for a quest in Darkshire later|r"] = "|cRXP_WARN_你需要 {C} 點|r {A}{B} |cRXP_WARN_技能，稍後夜色鎮的任務要用|r",
["|cRXP_WARN_You need {C}|r {A}{B} |cRXP_WARN_for a quest in Duskwood later|r"] = "|cRXP_WARN_你需要 {C} 點|r {A}{B} |cRXP_WARN_技能，稍後暮色森林的任務要用|r",
["|cRXP_WARN_You turn it in to High Priestess Laurena when you get to Stormwind|r"] = "|cRXP_WARN_到暴風城時把它交給高階牧師勞瑞娜|r",
["|cRXP_WARN_You will be able to do this quest at a higher level if you wish to skip it for now|r"] = "|cRXP_WARN_如果你想現在先跳過，等級更高時也還能做這個任務|r",
["|cRXP_WARN_You will need it to feed your owl, they only eat meat and there's no meat vendor in Darkshore|r"] = "|cRXP_WARN_你需要它來餵你的貓頭鷹，牠們只吃肉，而黑海岸沒有賣肉的商人|r",
["|cRXP_WARN_You will need your|r {A}{B} |cRXP_WARN_to be {C} for a quest at level {D}"] = "|cRXP_WARN_你的|r {A}{B} |cRXP_WARN_需要達到 {C}，才能完成 {D} 級的一個任務",
["|cRXP_WARN_You will need your|r {A}{B} |cRXP_WARN_to be {C} for a quest at level {D}|r"] = "|cRXP_WARN_你的|r {A}{B} |cRXP_WARN_需要達到 {C}，用於 {D} 級的一個任務|r",
["|cRXP_WARN_You will now do the quest chain for your|r {A}{B} |cRXP_WARN_ability. This will take ~{C} minutes and won't give much exp|r"] = "|cRXP_WARN_現在你將進行|r {A}{B} |cRXP_WARN_技能的任務鏈。這大約需要 {C} 分鐘，而且經驗值不多|r",
["|cRXP_WARN_You will train|r {A}{B} |cRXP_WARN_which increases early leveling speeds|r"] = "|cRXP_WARN_你將學習|r {A}{B} |cRXP_WARN_，它能提升前期練等速度|r",
["|cRXP_WARN_You'll receive {A}s {B}c from turnins until then|r"] = "|cRXP_WARN_在那之前你會從交付任務獲得 {A}銀{B}銅|r",
["|cRXP_WARN_You'll train|r {A}{B} |cRXP_WARN_later|r"] = "|cRXP_WARN_|r {A}{B} |cRXP_WARN_稍後再學習|r",
["|cRXP_WARN_walk onto the top of the bed, then jump onto the top of the bookshelf. Perform a Logout Skip by logging out and back in|r"] = "|cRXP_WARN_走到床頂上，然後跳到書架頂端。登出再登入，執行登出跳躍|r",
["|cRXP_WARN_{D} waves will spawn from the water, each after killing the previous wave: Wave {E} has {F} level {G}-{H} |cRXP_ENEMY_Greymist Coastrunners|r, Wave {I} has {J} level {K}-{L} {A}, and Wave {M} has a level {N} {B} and a level {O}-{P} {C}. You can move away from the Bonfire to avoid aggroing the next wave|r"] = "|cRXP_WARN_水中會出現 {D} 波怪物，每擊殺前一波後出現下一波：第 {E} 波為 {F} 隻 {G}-{H} 級|cRXP_ENEMY_灰霧灘行者|r，第 {I} 波為 {J} 隻 {K}-{L} 級{A}，第 {M} 波為一隻 {N} 級{B}和一隻 {O}-{P} 級{C}。你可以遠離營火以避免引來下一波|r",
}

